     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>Once your label design is finalized, it\u2019s time to bring your supplements to life.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Our <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">order</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">placement</span> and manufacturing process is designed to be as effortless as possible, allowing you to focus on building your brand.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 175%;\"><strong>Here\u2019s how we simplify it:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Easy Order Placement:</strong> We streamline the ordering process to get your products into production quickly and efficiently.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Top-Tier Manufacturing:</strong> <span style=\"background:#F8DDD9;border-bottom:2px solid #9B3B31;\" data-praxera-review=\"claim\">Our facilities</span> adhere to the highest standards, ensuring your supplements are produced with the utmost care and precision.<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong> Every product undergoes rigorous testing to ensure it meets your and your customers\u2019 expectations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>The Result?</strong></span></p>\n<p>High-quality supplements delivered on time, every time. You get to enjoy the peace of mind that comes with knowing your products are in expert hands.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;Have more questions? Check out our <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-resources\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">private label resources</a> or <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">contact one of our experts</a> today!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
